From 5b159f70c1d1ea4cb5fecd2a4eee55673b6897ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:21:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] apps: adapt Aperture to static light paper and ink

Rows, toolbar icons and secondary bar buttons have no frame at rest (selected inverted, pressed outlined, focused dashed); the shutter has no square frame around its round glyph; the gallery and QR cards use edges matching their 8dp and 12dp clips; the snackbar tint keeps its edge (multiply); the QR sheet strokes the shape drawable BottomSheetBehavior installs.
